      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/mkule/status/1965012470830907476",
      "text": "Our oppressors’ time is their birthright while our time continues to be a luxury.\n\nAnd while they spend their days resting with their banal routines, the masses have found the time to rage against the exposure of their children’s lavish lifestyles. Seeing the fruits of their sacrificed time in the Pateks and Rolexes on their oppressors’ wrists, those who sustain the shine of their opulence, who perpetually wade through rivers of floodwater and spend hours in traffic, cannot help but feel fury for the injustice of their situation.\n\nREAD: https://t.co/Pm2Jv0JpY7",
